  "intro": {
    "text": "For **can't**, make *bilmek* negative: *gelip bilmeýärin* (I can't come), *gelip bilmerin* (I won't be able to come), *gelip bilmedim* (I couldn't come). For a polite request, use the general present: *Kömek edip bilersiňizmi?*, could you help?",
    "see": "gp-yp-bilmek-negative"
  },
